KeepRecoveriesThroughAStopTest
├── when the zkPassport method is stopped before the request
│   └── it should judge, keep and spend the attempt as if no stop existed
├── when the Aadhaar method is stopped before the request
│   └── it should judge, keep and spend the attempt as if no stop existed
├── when a forged proof from the stopped method is counted
│   └── it should open the attempt and spend it the same way
├── when the holder's key answers a forged attempt
│   └── it should cancel it while the veto cannot
├── when a satisfying set answers a forged attempt
│   └── it should cancel it while the veto cannot
└── when the holder changes the choice
    └── it should take a fresh setup under the holder's key and never read the accepted attempt again
